    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῡλο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like a stilus,
			styloid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Onom.</u>
					142
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλ-</span> codd.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφυσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					2.252
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				271
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>UP</u>
					7.19
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβαρίζοντες -ειδεῖς
