				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῦλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
			</span></i>l.c., who glosses it by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραφιοειδής</span>: but Lat. <i>stilus</i> has
				<i>[icaron]</i>, not <i>ȳ.</i>) </div>
